{
  "plan": {
    "version": "0.1",
    "title": "马鞍面与鞍点：三维曲面中的临界点",
    "goals": [
      "理解双曲抛物面 z = x² - y² 的几何形态与马鞍结构",
      "通过 y=0 与 x=0 截面线掌握鞍点在不同方向上的极值差异",
      "通过动态平移截面体会梯度为零时临界点既非极大值也非极小值的几何本质"
    ],
    "teaching_strategies": [
      "从直觉整体形态过渡到特定方向的定点截面分析",
      "结合动画与互动操作，对比两组垂直平行截面的极值变化"
    ],
    "numbers": [
      {
        "initial": 0,
        "min": -2,
        "max": 2,
        "label": "截面位置",
        "student_control": {
          "kind": "slider",
          "step": 0.02
        }
      }
    ],
    "sections": [
      {
        "purpose": "建立对双曲抛物面 z = x² - y² 全局形态及原点马鞍特征的直观认识",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "note"
          },
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "visual",
            "capability": "function_surface_with_section"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "欢迎来到多元函数微分学的几何世界。今天我们要探索一个非常特殊的曲面——双曲抛物面，其方程为 z 等于 x 的平方减去 y 的平方。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "visual",
                "timing": "before_speech",
                "content": {
                  "capability": "function_surface_with_section",
                  "parameters": {
                    "title": "双曲抛物面 z = x² - y²",
                    "expression": "x^2 - y^2"
                  },
                  "numbers": [
                    1
                  ]
                },
                "role": "main_visual",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "new_region"
                },
                "reusable_item": 3
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "z = x^2 - y^2"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "请观察这个曲面的整体形状，它看起来非常像一个马鞍。请注意看最中间的原点位置。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦于原点(0,0,0)附近的马鞍结构",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "after_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "local_board_item",
                  "moment": 1,
                  "item": 1
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "在原点处，如果我们沿着前后的方向看，它是最低点；但沿着左右的方向看，它却是最高点。这种既是波谷又是波峰的点，在数学上被称为鞍点。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "note",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "title": "马鞍面结构特征",
                  "items": [
                    "原点 (0,0,0) 处梯度为零",
                    "沿着 x 轴方向：向上弯曲（波谷）",
                    "沿着 y 轴方向：向下弯曲（波峰）"
                  ]
                },
                "reusable_item": 2,
                "role": "explanation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 1,
                    "item": 2
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "scene3d_view",
            "prompt": "旋转视角，观察双曲抛物面在原点处的马鞍结构。",
            "hints": [
              "拖动鼠标旋转视角，从上方和侧面观察曲面弯曲方向",
              "注意观察原点沿着两个垂直方向的升降变化"
            ],
            "controls": [
              "orbit",
              "zoom",
              "reset"
            ],
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "match": "view_direction",
            "yaw": 0.7853981633974483,
            "pitch": 0.5235987755982988,
            "zoom": 1,
            "angular_tolerance": 0.03269908169872415,
            "zoom_tolerance": 0.1,
            "reference": {
              "source": "local_board_item",
              "moment": 1,
              "item": 1
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "分析沿 y = 0 截面切开的抛物线，说明原点在 x 方向上的极小值性质",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "现在我们来到双曲抛物面 z 等于 x 平方减 y 平方的前面。观察这块像马鞍一样的曲面，中心的原点形态非常特殊。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "观察双曲抛物面的整体马鞍结构与中心原点",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "当我们用平面 y 等于 0 沿着 x 轴方向切开曲面时，得到的截面曲线是一条开口向上的抛物线 z 等于 x 平方。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "z = x^2 \\quad (y = 0)"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "z = x^2 - y^2"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "point_at",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "reference": {
                  "source": "reusable",
                  "section": 1,
                  "item": 3
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "沿着这条抛物线看，原点 x 等于 0 恰好是它的最低点，也就是在 x 方向上取得了极小值 0。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "聚焦截面抛物线顶点，理解其在 x 方向上的极小值性质",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "purpose": "分析沿 x = 0 截面切开的抛物线，说明原点在 y 方向上的极大值性质",
        "reusable_items": [
          {
            "kind": "board_item",
            "board_kind": "math"
          }
        ],
        "moments": [
          {
            "narration": "现在我们来看另一个关键方向。请观察这个形似马鞍的三维曲面，中心的原点非常特殊，在不同方向上呈现出截然不同的弯曲状态。",
            "delivery": "patient",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "引导观察双曲抛物面的马鞍结构",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "当我们用平面 x = 0 切开曲面时，得到的截线是一条开口向下的抛物线 z = -y²。",
            "delivery": "neutral",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "x = 0 \\implies z = -y^2"
                },
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              },
              {
                "action": "create",
                "kind": "math",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "content": {
                  "latex": "z = x^2 - y^2"
                },
                "reusable_item": 1,
                "role": "derivation",
                "placement": {
                  "relation": "below",
                  "reference": {
                    "source": "local_board_item",
                    "moment": 2,
                    "item": 1
                  }
                }
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "narration": "沿着这条抛物线看，在原点 y = 0 处，函数值 z 取得了局部极大值 0。这与之前沿 x 方向看到的极小值正好相反。",
            "delivery": "emphatic",
            "actions": [
              {
                "action": "focus",
                "timing": "during_speech",
                "intent": "强调原点在 y 方向上取得极大值",
                "references": [
                  {
                    "source": "reusable",
                    "section": 1,
                    "item": 3
                  }
                ]
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "student_activities": [
          {
            "kind": "scene3d_view",
            "prompt": "调整视角观察 x = 0 截面切出的开口向下抛物线及其顶点",
            "hints": [
              "旋转视角到正前方，观察 yz 平面上的抛物线",
              "注意原点是该抛物线上的最高点"
            ],
            "success_message": "很好！你已经清楚地观察到了原点在 y 方向上的极大值特征。",
            "controls": [
              "orbit",
              "zoom",
              "preset"
            ],
            "hint_after_attempts": 2,
            "match": "view_direction",
            "yaw": 0,
            "pitch": 0,
            "zoom": 1,
            "angular_tolerance": 0.1308996938995747,
            "zoom_tolerance": 0.1,
            "reference": {
